      "Αξιολογηση": "Hyaluronic Acid is known as one of the most effective molecules that serves the skin’s need for beauty and health.\nHyaluronic Acid is a structural polysaccharide (belonging to the glycosaminoglycans GAG) and a key component of the skin’s matrix.\nIt is an extremely hydrophlilic molecule, a property that justifies many of its biological functions. It is estimated that it can sustain water up to 1000 times its weight.\nHyaluronic Acid is located in high concentration mainly in evolving or regenerating tissues.\nIt is considered the “key” substance for normal tissue regeneration and the enhancement of skin’s healing and reconstructive capacity.\nHyaluronic Acid controls skin’s water content, transfers nutrients and proteins, increasing its moisture and improving its elasticity.\nIt also increases the skin’s resistance against harmful external factors.\nFurthermore it helps in the formation of new cells, in collagen production, protects cells from free radicals and helps to reduce inflammatory reactions.\nFroika’s Hyaluronic Line has combined Hyaluronic acid with other active ingredients to ensure optimal hydration along with regeneration and improvement of the skin."
