      "Συστατικά": "Aqua, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice, Glycerin, Propanediol, Polysorbate 20, Phenoxyethanol, Caprylyl Glycol, Polyacrylate Crosspolymer-11, Mel, Peg-20 Glyceryl Laurate, Phospholipids, Sodium Hyaluronate, Butylene Glycol, Parfum, Chamomilla Recutita (Matricaria) Flower Extract, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Hyaluronic Acid, Sphingolipids, Tocopherol, Linoleic Acid, Brassica Oleracea Italica (Broccoli) Extract, Bioflavonoids, Retinyl Palmitate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Diethylhexyl Syringylidenemalonate",
